%% Rain sandbox POC - Rain-managed CORPORATE card program
%% Renders in GitHub, mermaid.live, Notion, Obsidian, VS Code (Markdown Preview Mermaid)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant POC as POC backend
    participant API as Rain API<br/>/v1/issuing
    participant SIM as Rain sandbox<br/>/v1/simulate
    participant HOOK as Webhook receiver

    Note over POC,HOOK: Every webhook: HMAC-SHA256 over the raw body, then 2xx fast

    Note over POC,HOOK: 1 - Onboard the business (KYB)
    POC->>API: POST /applications/company<br/>entity + address + representatives + UBOs
    API-->>POC: 200 IssuingCompany {id, applicationStatus}
    API->>HOOK: company.updated
    POC->>API: PUT /applications/company/{id}/document
    POC->>API: GET /applications/company/{id}
    API-->>POC: approved, per-UBO statuses

    Note over POC,HOOK: 2 - Deploy the company collateral contract
    POC->>API: POST /companies/{id}/contracts<br/>{chainId, ownerAddress}
    API-->>POC: 202 Accepted (async deploy)
    API->>HOOK: contract.created
    POC->>API: GET /companies/{id}/contracts
    API-->>POC: [{id, proxyAddress, adminAddresses}]

    Note over POC,HOOK: 3 - Fund collateral (sandbox only)
    POC->>SIM: POST /simulate/collateral/fund<br/>{contractId, rusd, amount}
    SIM-->>POC: 200 {transactionId}
    SIM->>HOOK: transaction.created (collateral)
    POC->>API: GET /companies/{id}/balances
    API-->>POC: spendingPower > 0

    Note over POC,HOOK: 4 - Add employees, issue their cards
    POC->>API: POST /companies/{id}/users
    API-->>POC: 200 IssuingUser {id}
    POC->>API: POST /users/{userId}/cards<br/>{virtual, active, limit}
    API-->>POC: 200 IssuingCard {id, last4, expiry}
    API->>HOOK: card.updated
    Note right of POC: employees share the company contract<br/>no per-user collateral

    Note over POC,HOOK: 5 - Configure and control
    POC->>API: PATCH /cards/{cardId} {limit}
    POC->>API: PATCH /cards/{cardId} {status: locked}
    API->>HOOK: card.updated

    Note over POC,HOOK: 6 - Authorize, then settle
    POC->>SIM: POST /simulate/transactions/authorize
    SIM-->>POC: 200 {transactionId, status: authorized}
    SIM->>HOOK: transaction.created (spend)
    POC->>API: GET /companies/{id}/balances
    API-->>POC: pendingCharges rises

    POC->>SIM: PATCH /simulate/transactions/{id}/authorize {amount}
    SIM->>HOOK: transaction.updated

    POC->>SIM: POST /simulate/transactions/{id}/settle
    SIM-->>POC: 200 {status: settled, SETTLEMENT}
    SIM->>HOOK: transaction.completed
    POC->>API: GET /companies/{id}/balances
    API-->>POC: pending clears, postedCharges rises

    Note over POC,HOOK: 7 - Exception paths
    POC->>SIM: POST /simulate/transactions/authorize {declineReason}
    SIM-->>POC: 200 {status: declined, declinedReason}
    POC->>SIM: POST /simulate/transactions/{id}/reverse
    SIM-->>POC: 200 hold released, nothing posted
    POC->>SIM: POST /simulate/transactions/{id}/refund
    SIM-->>POC: 200 {completionReason: REFUND}
    POC->>API: POST /transactions/{id}/disputes
    API-->>POC: 200 IssuingDispute {status: pending}
    API->>HOOK: dispute.created
